.env

# --- Pragmatika dedomena: NA MIN MPAINOUN POTE STO REPO ---
# Exports apo SAP i alla systimata tis etaireias periexoun pragmatika stoixeia
# (kodikous mihanon, perigrafes vlavon, onomata xriston). To repo tha ginei
# DIMOSIO prin tin paradosi, opote tetoia arxeia den prepei na yparxoun oute
# stin istoria tou git.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv

# Eksairesi: MONO ta tessera dika mas ypodeigmata, pou exoun apokleistika
# FANTASTIKA dedomena. Ta grafoume ONOMA-ONOMA epitides: an grafame "!samples/*.xlsx",
# tote opoiodipote arxeio erixname sto samples/ tha anevaine - kai arkei mia fora
# na to kanoume katalathos me pragmatiko arxeio.
!samples/maintrack-import-demo.xlsx
!samples/sap-iw29-demo.xlsx
!samples/agnosti-morfi-demo.xlsx
!samples/xeirokinito-log-demo.xlsx

# --- Build output ---
node_modules/
dist/
target/
